| **Operation**  | **C++**                                              | **Java**                                             | **Python**               |
| -------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------ |
| **Create**     | `priority_queue<int, vector<int>, greater<int>> pq;` | `PriorityQueue<Integer> pq = new PriorityQueue<>();` | `pq = []`                |
| **Import**     | `#include <queue>`<br>`#include <vector>`            | `import java.util.PriorityQueue;`                    | `import heapq`           |
| **Add**        | `pq.push(30);`                                       | `pq.offer(30);`                                      | `heapq.heappush(pq, 30)` |
| **Top / Peek** | `pq.top()`                                           | `pq.peek()`                                          | `pq[0]`                  |
| **Remove**     | `pq.pop()`                                           | `pq.poll()`                                          | `heapq.heappop(pq)`      |
| **Size**       | `pq.size()`                                          | `pq.size()`                                          | `len(pq)`                |
| **Empty**      | `pq.empty()`                                         | `pq.isEmpty()`                                       | `not pq`                 |
| **Swap**       | `pq.swap(pq2)`                                       | Manual swap                                          | `pq, pq2 = pq2, pq`      |


 
